CREATED:20261104T144857Z
DESCRIPTION:Um Lobo Entre os Cisnes (A Wolf Among Swans). 2025. Dir. Marco
 s Schechtman\, Helena Varvaki (Brazil). 112 min.\nThiago Soares\, one of 
 Brazil's greatest ballet dancers\, is offering a compelling study of arti
 stic excellence emerging from marginalized communities. Because the mento
 r-student relationship invites critical discussion about power dynamics\,
  cultural transmission\, and the transformative process of artistic forma
 tion. And because its cross-cultural narrative-from Rio's favelas to the 
 Royal Ballet in London-provides rich material for examining class mobilit
 y\, cultural capital\, and the globalization of the performing arts. A Wo
 lf Among Swans is a biographical drama that follows the extraordinary jou
 rney of Thiago Soares\, a boy from the suburbs of Rio de Janeiro who trad
 es the rhythms of hip hop for the discipline of classical ballet.
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20261104T144857Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T090000
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T144857Z
