DESCRIPTION:We're bringing the GBS\, CIDP\, and MMN* community together on
  November 14th!\n\nCommunity Day empowers patients\, care partners\, and 
 healthcare providers with the latest information on these rare conditions
  while fostering connection\, understanding\, and access to high-quality 
 care.\n\nFor patients\, whether you're newly diagnosed or further along i
 n your journey\, Community Day provides education\, understanding\, and c
 ommunity to help you feel informed\, empowered\, and supported.\n\n*Guill
 ain-Barré Syndrome (GBS)\, Chronic Inflammatory Demyelinating Polyneuropa
 thy (CIDP)\, and Multifocal Motor Neuropathy (MMN). Visit www.gbs-cidp.or
 g for more info. To register\, visit: https://www.gbs-cidp.org/event/durh
 am-north-carolina-community-day/
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T143000
