CREATED:20261104T143934Z
DESCRIPTION:Comparsa. 2025. Dir. Vickie Curtis and Doug Anderson. (Guatema
 la/USA). 79 min.\nComparsa is a compelling\, intimate portrait of young w
 omen using art to heal their community in the aftermath of violence. From
  the shadows of a Guatemalan barrio scared into silence\, sisters Lesli a
 nd Lupe lead a luminous rebellion-unleashing joy\, art\, and radical trut
 h in an epic fight for survival. The film sheds light on the true cost of
  gender-based violence\, the role of art in building resistance and resil
 ience\, and the transformative potential of grassroots youth action.
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20261104T143934Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T140000
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T143934Z
