CREATED:20260714T175347Z
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the talent and dedication of young musicians from th
 e Duke University String School at the "Violin and Cello Choir Concert."\
 n\nFeaturing student performers in a lively ensemble setting\, this conce
 rt highlights the rich sounds of the violin and cello while showcasing co
 llaboration\, musical growth\, and the joy of making music together. \n\n
 Additional program details will be announced soon.\n\nThis event is free 
 and open to the public. All are welcome.
