CREATED:20261104T183339Z
DESCRIPTION:Our beloved Head Chef of the Freeman Center Cafe\, Chef Sebast
 ian\, is currently undergoing chemotherapy to battle a rare form of cance
 r known as liposarcoma. Chef Sebastian has always been dedicated to his w
 ork and his community\, and now is the time to show him our support! In a
 n effort to raise money to help pay for his treatments\, Jewish Student U
 nion is hosting a color run on November 15th at 10:00am open to Duke stud
 ents\, faculty\, staff\, and the community. The race will begin at 10:00a
 m at the White Lecture Hall. To register\, please visit https://duke.is/C
 olorRun. As a part of the registration\, we encourage you to donate to hi
 s GoFundMe\, and as a thank you\, the first 100 people at the run who don
 ated $10 or more will receive a t-shirt while limited supplies last for t
 he run! The route is two laps around the East Campus Loop (5K or 3.1mi). 
 Community members are welcome to come\; all minors must be accompanied by
  an adult.
DURATION:PT2H30M
