CREATED:20261021T153641Z
DESCRIPTION:The mission of Ronald McDonald House is to provide essential s
 ervices that remove barriers\, strengthen families\, and promote healing 
 when children need healthcare. Our vision is a world where all children h
 ave access to medical care and their families are supported and actively 
 involved in their children's care.\n\nNancy Jones\, Chief Philanthropy Of
 ficer for RMHCTriangle\,  is a distinguished leader in philanthropy and n
 on-profit advancement\, with extensive experience dedicated to driving im
 pactful missions within charitable organizations and a consistent commitm
 ent to fundraising\, strategic development\, and fostering strong donor r
 elationships.\n\nAdult Forum welcomes a variety of guest speakers who sha
 re thought-provoking presentations and discussions on topics ranging from
  biblical studies and current social issues to mission work. Join us in p
 erson in the Divinity School Westbrook building\, Lower Level Room 0012\,
  or online via Zoom.
DURATION:PT1H
