 e Duke University String School at this engaging orchestra concert.\n\nFe
 aturing student performers in a full ensemble setting\, the program highl
 ights musical growth\, collaboration\, and the excitement of bringing orc
 hestral music to life. \n\nAdditional program details will be announced s
 oon.\n\nThis event is free and open to the public. All are welcome.
