  Monica
CREATED:20230805T023014Z
DESCRIPTION:The lab of Daniel Croll wants to understand how pathogens evol
 ve to cause disease. For this\, we focus mainly on major crop pathogens a
 nd investigate mechanisms of rapid adaptation. We are interested in how h
 ost resistance mechanisms are circumvented\, how pesticides become ineffe
 ctive\, and how pathogens are able to cope with climate challenges. We ta
 ke a broad view in our work and have strong interests in processes of gen
 ome evolution at all levels\, from transposable element dynamics to broad
  species comparisons. We combine computational work with empirical analys
 es from the field to the bench.
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20261104T002111Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261116T120000
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T002111Z
