DESCRIPTION:Duke University's Pratt School of Engineering and Character Fo
 rward invites you to the moderated panel discussion\, "The Moral Complexi
 ty of Defense Engineering." \n\nJoin us for a moderated panel discussion\
 , small group conversation and audience Q & A. "Should Engineers build we
 apons? How can engineers act with integrity in the defense industry? Wher
 e would you draw the line?"\n\nPanelists: Provost Alec Gallimore\, Genera
 l (Ret.) C.Q. Brown Jr.\, Dean Edgardo Colon-Emeric\, Professor Robin Kir
 k. All are welcome.
